[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:5. Nice to Meet You]
[00:00.500]Lesson 5|第5课
[00:02.625]Good morning, Mr. Blake.|早上好，布莱克先生。
[00:08.720]This is Miss Alice Dupont.|这是爱丽丝·杜邦小姐。
[00:12.760]Alice is a new student.|爱丽丝是一名新学生。
[00:15.585]She is French.|她是法国人。
[00:18.570]Alice, this is Hans.|爱丽丝，这是汉斯。
[00:23.065]He is German.|他是德国人。
[00:25.075]How do you do?|你好！
[00:27.525]And this is Britt.|这是布里特。
[00:30.800]She is Swedish.|她是瑞典人。
[00:32.980]How do you do?|你好！
[00:35.605]And this is Dimitri.|这是迪米特里。
[00:39.160]He is Greek.|他是希腊人。
[00:41.090]How do you do?|你好！
[00:43.485]And this is Paul.|这是保罗。
[00:46.655]He's Brazilian.|他是巴西人。
[00:48.925]How do you do?|你好！
[00:51.355]And this is Stella.|这是斯特拉。
[00:54.470]She's Spanish.|她是西班牙人。
[00:56.325]How do you do?|你好！